      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROW BEAU (2) goes very well this trip starting 12 times for four wins and five minors. Placed last time (30.22) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 7 lengths. Looks suited and should go close. STAND UP TONY (3) is a talented dog who is a winner of seven races but missed the frame last time when fifth at Nowra (29.99). Has good early burn and is drawn to be prominent. Cannot be taken lightly. CANYA LET LOOSE (8) hit the ground running and never headed, leading throughout to win by 10 lengths over 520m at this track (30.03). Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Significant danger. PSYCHO SUSIE (1) generally performs well from this box.",
